    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/writer-portfolio/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Writer Portfolio theme is a professionally designed, mobile-friendly portfolio site template ideal for authors, bloggers, journalists, copywriters, poets, novelists, screenwriters, editors, content creators, and freelance writers aiming to build a strong digital presence. Whether you’re showcasing technical writing, blog posts, essays, creative writing, eBooks, short stories, or storytelling projects, this theme features typography-focused layouts and intuitive navigation that enhance readability and audience engagement. Built using clean code and secure design practices, it offers search engine optimization (SEO), fast loading speed, and translation-ready support to improve reach and accessibility. With built-in portfolio templates for content marketing, ghostwriting, book writing, travel writing, screenplay portfolios, and article publishing, it enables users to organize work samples efficiently. The theme supports multimedia elements such as podcasts, audio snippets, book previews, and embedded videos—perfect for scriptwriting portfolios, poetry collections, and digital publishing. It includes features like a blog module, author bio section, testimonials, social sharing options, contact form integration, and newsletter sign-ups to help writers establish thought leadership, attract publishers, and convert visitors into clients. With plugins like Contact Form 7 and Smash Balloon Social Photo Feed, the Writer Portfolio theme offers a clean, minimalistic yet creative layout tailored for writing agencies, book authors, and creative professionals seeking a polished online portfolio."
    },
